  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.1,
      494.2,
      543.63,
      546.67
    ],
    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me under section 3 of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) No. 16 of 1907, as amended by Act No. 13 of 1966 (reprint), No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009, I, the Minister of Environment do by this Order declare the state land of the extent 46.44 hectares located in the area bounded by the limits set forth in the schedule given below, as Thulhirikanda Reserved Forest from 04th day of June 2025.",
